    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93da130cd94d190e534bb290",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "曾拥有如此无与伦比的强大，\n以至于诞生了这句格言的鲁道夫象征，和杏目。\n两人看向的方向截然不同――",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5927625cf649c2e0c6ccd6c8ccaff8cd365e6481bfcad0eb070b90a942da21e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        74,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/74/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:890529f42865bfd87aa1f383",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只是在自己坚信的道路上，全力奔跑。\n那份意志的坚定，感觉在某种程度上有些相似。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e29ff5f1c2b78c41891383d8f621d664c201bccd74a2699dd2049ba7cb77d592",
